# The public URL the site is served from, e.g. https://prashantraghu.com. It is
# the base for the canonical link, the OpenGraph image URL, robots.txt and the
# sitemap, and is read at build time. Only its origin is used, and a bare
# domain gets https://. Set it in the Vercel project. Left empty, Vercel's
# production domain (VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL) is used, and outside Vercel
# http://localhost:3000. On Vercel preview builds Next points og:image at the
# preview deployment itself.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
